<title>FINLAND: KEMIRA BUYS ITALIAN WATER CHEMICALS FIRM.</title>
<headline>KEMIRA BUYS ITALIAN WATER CHEMICALS FIRM.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish chemicals group Kemira Oy said in a statement on Friday its Swedish subsidiary Kemira Kemi AB would buy Italian water chemicals company MARE WTS S.p.A..</p>
<p>The price of the deal was not given. Kemira said the company's annual net sales were about 70 million markka.  </p>
<p>The Italian company will be renamed Kemira Chimica S.p.A.</p>
<p>&quot;The acquisition of MARE WTS will further strengthen (Kemira') market position in southern Europe,&quot; Kemira said, adding MARE WTS was strong on the Italian market and was exporting its products to neighbouring countries like France.</p>
<p>--Helsinki Newsroom  +358 - 9 - 680 50 245</p>
</text>
